From fd559b82f6e0fdd10200ea370b4669a1938644da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Aug 2024 02:21:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 29/62] i386/tdx: Enable user exit on KVM_HC_MAP_GPA_RANGE

KVM translates TDG.VP.VMCALL<MapGPA> to KVM_HC_MAP_GPA_RANGE, and QEMU
needs to enable user exit on KVM_HC_MAP_GPA_RANGE in order to handle the
memory conversion requested by TD guest.

Signed-off-by: Xiaoyao Li <xiaoyao.li@intel.com>
---
changes in v6:
 - new patch;
---
